13:51.830 --> 13:54.799
Gentlemen,
I've got something here...

13:54.866 --> 13:57.960
that's gonna send our friend
on the first train back to Israel.

13:58.036 --> 14:01.403
- Eggs?
- Yeah. These eggs are organic.

14:01.473 --> 14:05.239
They're, like, three times the size
of normal eggs and twice the price.

14:05.310 --> 14:09.371
If this doesn't show this guy
we mean business, nothing's gonna.

14:09.447 --> 14:11.074
- I'm in.
- Okay.

14:11.149 --> 14:14.084
- Whoa. What are you talking about, you're in?
- Hey, it's something, Mac.

14:14.152 --> 14:16.086
Oh, it's something.
Let's just do something.

14:16.154 --> 14:18.554
I wonder how long it took him
to get that toilet paper down.

14:18.623 --> 14:20.557
Didn't even notice
the toilet paper.

14:23.495 --> 14:25.429
What? Where does...

14:25.497 --> 14:27.488
What the hell is this?
He put up a fence.

14:27.566 --> 14:30.592
- He didn't notice the toilet paper? He put up a fence.
- He walled us in.

14:30.669 --> 14:33.263
- He walled us in!
- Where does it end and where does it begin?

14:33.338 --> 14:35.602
- This guy's good.
- Okay. This guy wants to get extreme?

14:35.674 --> 14:37.608
Let's get extreme.
Screw the eggs.

14:37.676 --> 14:40.110
- How far does this thing go?
- Back to the bar. Plan "B."

14:40.178 --> 14:42.373
- It's locked. You guys have your keys?
- Go around front.

14:42.447 --> 14:43.937
- Go, go, go.
- Fine. Fine. Fine.

14:44.015 --> 14:45.949
- Wait. Hold on. It gets thinner.
- Squeeze through there.

14:46.017 --> 14:48.110
It gets thinner, Dennis!
Wait! Don't push me!

14:48.186 --> 14:50.916
- Wait, wait, wait! My toe's caught in the fence!
- Go back!

14:50.989 --> 14:53.924
- That's fine. Just go back. Just go back.
- I can't move! I can't...

14:53.992 --> 14:56.290
- Come on! You guys gotta go!
- Stop yelling!

14:56.361 --> 14:58.659
- Stop yelling!
- Go over! Go over! I'll lift you.

14:58.730 --> 15:00.254
Don't climb! Don't climb, Dennis!

15:00.332 --> 15:02.926
- That son of a bitch! He put up a wall!
- Hop over!

15:03.001 --> 15:04.491
- Hop?
- Climb over!

15:04.569 --> 15:07.163
- Happy place!
- Climb over and get help!

15:07.239 --> 15:10.208
Oh, this son of a bitch! You son of a bitch!

15:13.011 --> 15:16.242
Okay. Now what are we doing,
holding it for ransom or something?

15:16.314 --> 15:18.578
I haven't thought this
all the way through.

15:18.650 --> 15:21.778
You haven't thought it through?
It destroyed my apartment.

15:21.853 --> 15:25.584
Look. We're living in the moment.
We're running around stealing things.

15:25.657 --> 15:27.989
- We're doing anything we want.
- Stop talking like that.

15:28.059 --> 15:31.495
- You and I ought to team up on stuff like this more often.
- Oh, no, we shouldn't.

15:31.563 --> 15:33.758
- Oh, yeah. And also...
- You're not on my team.

15:33.832 --> 15:38.496
I want to team up with Mac, because he seems
stupid enough to do anything.

15:38.570 --> 15:42.028
Okay, knock it off. You're not teaming up
with any of us. Nobody wants you around.

15:42.107 --> 15:44.166
Oh...

15:46.077 --> 15:48.671
God damn it. That doesn't...
I'm gonna sit here until you use words.

15:48.747 --> 15:50.339
That doesn't mean anything.
This doesn't mean anything.

15:50.415 --> 15:53.316
Your mother might be here,
so take the dog into the bedroom.

15:53.385 --> 15:56.286
- That's fine. You take it.
- You take the dog! I'm telling you!

15:56.354 --> 15:59.016
Fine. Okay, but this is exactly
why you're not part of our gang.

15:59.090 --> 16:01.081
God damn it! Where'd it go?

16:07.899 --> 16:10.732
- What the hell do you want?
- Your wife says she's afraid of you.

16:10.802 --> 16:13.396
- I'm here for the dog.
- Ooh!

16:13.471 --> 16:16.736
That woman is amazing.
She is amazing.

16:16.808 --> 16:19.538
You just met her. She's already got you
running errands for her.

16:19.611 --> 16:22.079
She's good.
She is good.

16:22.147 --> 16:24.911
- Just go get the dog.
- I don't have the dog.

16:24.983 --> 16:28.749
So you've been in here
tearing apart pillows and...

16:28.820 --> 16:31.015
pooping on the floor?

16:32.624 --> 16:34.558
Yes.

16:34.626 --> 16:36.685
I'm starting to lose
patience with you people.

16:36.761 --> 16:39.924
I've already had to deal with your son
and his retarded friends.

16:39.998 --> 16:43.434
My contractor just told me there's a gas leak
in that goddamn building I just bought.

16:43.501 --> 16:47.437
The whole thing
is becoming a big pain in my ass.

16:47.505 --> 16:50.440
Go get the dog.

16:52.077 --> 16:55.274
I have a little business proposition
I want to talk to you about...

16:55.347 --> 16:57.281
out in the hallway.

16:59.084 --> 17:01.450
You guys feeling extreme?

17:02.554 --> 17:04.715
Ah, this looks beautiful.

17:04.789 --> 17:07.622
- Okay. You guys ready for this?
- I'm ready. I'm ready. Let's do this.

17:07.692 --> 17:10.957
Okay, okay, okay.
And... action.

17:15.633 --> 17:18.101
Cut, cut, cut, cut!
What the hell are you doing, dude?

17:19.304 --> 17:21.499
That's what those tapes
sound like.

17:21.573 --> 17:23.268
Why don't you read
the script I wrote?

17:23.341 --> 17:25.741
I'm not reading the script. It's in English
and riddled with spelling errors.

17:25.810 --> 17:27.937
You know what I'm trying
to write. Say it.

17:28.013 --> 17:29.776
I'm gonna mumble guttural sounds.
Let's do another one.

17:29.848 --> 17:32.373
- He's not gonna know what you're saying!
- We'll do subtitles.

17:32.450 --> 17:34.441
I feel like I should
have something in my hands.

17:34.519 --> 17:36.453
- You don't need anything in your hands.
- Like a weapon.

17:36.521 --> 17:40.116
- A machete or a machine gun.
- Why don't you head down to the Wawa and pick up a machine gun?

17:40.191 --> 17:41.920
- Read the script.
- I'm not gonna read the script.

17:41.993 --> 17:44.621
- Who's the director here?
- I don't care. I'm not reading the script.

17:44.696 --> 17:47.324
- Fine. Action!
- Bro, can I get my towel over my face again?

17:47.399 --> 17:49.094
- Put your towel on your face.
- Here we go.

17:49.167 --> 17:51.192
Action!

17:51.269 --> 17:54.761
- I'm gonna get a weapon!
- You don't need a...

17:54.839 --> 17:58.172
He's gonna go get a weapon, everybody!
Everybody! Everybody get a weapon!

17:59.577 --> 18:02.341
Can we... You think we can make this look
more like a cave?

18:10.789 --> 18:14.885
You not make restaurant here.
Bad decision.

18:17.562 --> 18:20.087
We will crush your skull
with our weapons!

18:24.636 --> 18:26.570
- We can't send this.
- Nope.

18:26.638 --> 18:28.731
- What are you guys talking about?
- We're gonna get arrested.

18:28.807 --> 18:31.173
Yeah, or murdered.
This is a little too extreme, Charlie.

18:31.242 --> 18:33.176
- Man, I feel sick.
- Me too.

18:33.244 --> 18:35.405
What, you think I don't feel sick?
Okay. I'm sick.

18:35.480 --> 18:38.108
I feel very sick, but I directed the shit
out of this video.

18:38.183 --> 18:40.743
- This stuff is gold.
- You're not the one on TV...

18:40.819 --> 18:43.583
dressed like a terrorist
threatening Jews, Charlie.

18:43.655 --> 18:45.589
- Oh, Mac...
- That context was fine, Dennis. Trust me.

18:45.657 --> 18:47.921
I was thinking about it
when we were watching the video.

18:47.992 --> 18:50.085
All right. Okay.
What are we supposed to do then?

18:50.161 --> 18:52.755
Can I throw a bag of poop through the window?

18:52.831 --> 18:54.765
Yes.

19:03.108 --> 19:05.702
I have better aim than you.
I should throw the bag of poop.

19:05.777 --> 19:08.211
Dude, I sat over the bag for 20 minutes.
I'm throwing it.

19:08.279 --> 19:10.008
- Hey, guys.
- Hey, Dee.

19:10.081 --> 19:13.107
- What are you doing?
- We're gonna throw this bag of poop through this guy's window.

19:13.184 --> 19:15.118
- You wanna come? Yeah.
- Mm-hmm.

19:17.188 --> 19:19.554
Hey, there's no one
even in there!

19:19.624 --> 19:22.092
Well, just throw the bag in
anyway, dude.

19:22.160 --> 19:24.685
Yeah, but no one's gonna
get poop on their shoes!

19:24.762 --> 19:27.458
Just throw the damn bag,
Charlie.

19:27.532 --> 19:29.693
- All right! Oh!
- Why are we doing this?

19:29.767 --> 19:32.736
- We're gonna teach this guy a lesson.
- Awesome.

19:32.804 --> 19:36.535
This is gonna be great.
It's gonna smell so bad in there.

19:36.608 --> 19:39.475
I just hope he gets the message.

19:47.952 --> 19:52.286
Uh, I think this is
the wrong message.

19:52.357 --> 19:54.291
Yeah.

20:18.583 --> 20:20.517
All right, so this here...

20:20.585 --> 20:22.519
is the pillar
that I want to remove.

20:22.587 --> 20:25.454
I want to get this out of here
so there's a nice wide open space...

20:25.523 --> 20:27.753
- when people walk into the bar.
- What are you doing, Dad?

20:27.825 --> 20:31.124
In a second, Dennis. And, uh, go into
the bathroom. Check out the fixtures.

20:31.196 --> 20:33.130
I'll be in in a second.

20:33.198 --> 20:36.531
- What the hell's going on?
- He's renovating my bar.

20:36.601 --> 20:39.126
- Your bar?
- Yeah, my bar.

20:39.204 --> 20:42.139
You see, the property
that I just purchased...

20:42.207 --> 20:46.644
extends from Morgan Street
all the way to right here.

20:46.711 --> 20:48.906
What the hell are you talking about?
The property you bought?

20:48.980 --> 20:51.175
The building you blew up.
The building you set on fire.

20:51.249 --> 20:54.150
What'd you think,
I wasn't gonna find out about that? Hmm!

20:54.219 --> 20:56.483
I'll give you two choices.

20:56.554 --> 20:58.749
I'm part of the gang...

20:58.823 --> 21:01.883
or I send your asses to jail.

21:01.960 --> 21:04.724
- I would rather go to jail than work with you.
- Yes!

21:04.796 --> 21:07.526
Just for the record,
I would rather not spend my life in jail.

21:07.599 --> 21:10.591
- I will tear this bar to the ground.
- I will kick the pillars in!

21:10.668 --> 21:12.602
- Nobody's kicking anything.
- She will kick the pillars!

21:12.670 --> 21:16.106
- I will tear...
- Okay, here's what we're gonna do! Everyone, relax.

21:16.174 --> 21:18.904
Frank, congratulations.
You're captain of the gang.

21:18.977 --> 21:20.911
- No! Charlie...
- Charlie, shut your mouth!

21:20.979 --> 21:23.447
Why can't you just die
and leave your money to your kids...

21:23.514 --> 21:25.675
like normal parents of America?

21:25.750 --> 21:29.550
- You sound like your mother.
- You say that to my face!

21:29.621 --> 21:32.419
- Excuse me.
- I will kick and tear...

21:32.490 --> 21:35.926
Excuse me!

21:35.994 --> 21:39.088
Thank you.
We're looking for the owners.

21:39.163 --> 21:41.028
Oh. We're the owners.

21:41.099 --> 21:43.966
I'm Detective Tanner.
This here is Detective Volpe.

21:44.035 --> 21:47.163
Gentlemen, we're gonna
have to talk to you for a moment.

21:47.238 --> 21:49.172
About what?

21:49.240 --> 21:53.438
You gentlemen know anything
about this?

21:55.380 --> 21:59.476
Uh...

21:59.550 --> 22:02.383
Oh...

22:02.453 --> 22:04.387
shit.
